{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50258","headline":"魏夫人归大霍山 · 李翔","name":"魏夫人归大霍山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受锡南归大霍宫，衆真同会绦房中。\n裘披鳯锦千花丽，斾绰龙霞八景红。\n羽帔俨排三洞客，仙歌凝韵九天风。\n元君未许人先起，更待云璈一曲终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}